OL,3,GNEWSAResidents and States clash over
OL,4,Afuture of vinery
OL,5,
OL,6,FPlans for up to 50 affordable homes
OL,7,Fhave been defended by a planning
OL,8,Fauthority, despite opposition from
OL,9,Fresidents and an independent planning
OL,10,Finspector.
OL,12,FNeil Inder, president of Guernsey's
OL,13,FDevelopment & Planning Authority (DPA),
OL,14,Fsaid the authority disagreed with parts
OL,15,Fof the inspector's report that did not
OL,16,Fsupport developing Whispers Vinery or
OL,17,Fturning the surrounding area into a
OL,18,Flocal centre.
OL,23,APub: 05-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
