OL,3,GNEWSAResidents and States clash over
OL,4,Afuture of vinery
OL,5,
OL,6,FSpeaking after a public meeting on
OL,7,FWednesday, attended by dozens of
OL,8,Fparishioners, local resident Nick
OL,9,FGuillemette said he was against the
OL,10,Fplans as there was "too much
OL,11,Fdevelopment in the area already".
OL,13,FThe States is due to vote on the
OL,14,Fproposals later in November.
